#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "About Jabber XMPP"
msgstr "O Jabber-u XMPP"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XMPP\">XMPP</ulink> or Jabber "
"(these words actually mean the same) is the name of an open, decentral "
"network protocol which is used for instant messaging. It is designed as a "
"server-client-infrastructure with many servers all over the Internet, where "
"everyone can get an account. The <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Server_%28computing%29\">servers</ulink> are normally connected to many "
"<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Client_%28computing%29\">clients</"
"ulink> on one side and to other XMPP-servers of the Internet on the other "
"side. Let's invent a small example to explain how it's working:"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XMPP\">XMPP</ulink> ili Jabber "
"(ove riječi imaju isto značenje) je ime za otvoreni, decentralizovani mrežni "
"protokol koji je iskorišten za instantno pisanje poruka. Dizajniran je kao "
"server-klijent-infrastruktura sa serverima širom Interneta, gdje se svako "
"može registrovati.\n"
" <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Server_%28computing%29\">servers</"
"ulink> su normalno konektovani na <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Client_%28computing%29\">clients</ulink> sa jedne strane i sa druge na "
"Internet XMPP-servere. Pokažimo na malom primjeru kako radi:"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Romeo loves Juliet and wants to communicate with her through the Jabber "
"network. He can write messages from his client (which is connected with "
"<userinput>montague.net</userinput>) to his girlfriend, whose client is "
"connected to a server called <userinput>capulet.com</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Romeo voli Juliju i želi razgovarati sa njom preko Jabber mreže. Može pisati "
"poruke sa svog klijenta (koji je povezan sa <userinput>montague.net</"
"userinput>) svojom djevojkom, čiji je klijent povezan sa serverom "
"naziva<userinput>capulet.com</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When he registered an account on a server, he chose a so-called JID (Jabber-"
"Identifier). This JID works basically like an E-Mail-Address and is "
"connected to the server's name with an <quote>@</quote>. An example for "
"Romeo's valid JID is <userinput>romeo@montague.net</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Kada je napravio račun na serveru, izabrao je takozvani JID (Jabber-"
"Identifikator). Ovaj JID u suštini radi kao E-mail-adresa i spojen je na ime "
"servera sa <quote>@</quote>. Primjer za  Romeov ispravni JID je "
"<userinput>romeo@montague.net</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to talk to other people, Romeo has to add their JIDs to his contact "
"list. They may be connected to the same server (&eg; <userinput>bob@montague."
"net</userinput>) as well as they can originate from another server (&eg; "
"<userinput>peter@wasinet.org</userinput> or, of course, "
"<userinput>juliet@capulet.com</userinput>)."
msgstr ""
"Da bi pričao sa drugim ljudima, Romeo mora dodati njihove JID-ove na svoju "
"kontakt listu. Mogu biti spojeni na isti server  (&eg; "
"<userinput>bob@montague.net</userinput>) kao što mogu da potiču i sa drugih "
"servera (&eg; <userinput>peter@wasinet.org</userinput> ili, naravno, "
"<userinput>juliet@capulet.com</userinput>)."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Visualization of the Jabber network</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Vizualizacija Jabber mreže</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Visualization of the Jabber network</para>"
msgstr "<para>Vizualizacija Jabber mreže</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Jabber/XMPP is of course capable of a lot more services (&eg; end-to-end "
"encryption of the messages, <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Voicechat\">voice-</ulink> and <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Video_conferencing\">videochat</ulink>, groupchat), which the tutorial will "
"partly introduce later."
msgstr ""
"Jabber/XMPP je naravno podoban i za mnoge druge usluge (&eg; end-to-end "
"encryption of the messages, <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Voicechat\">voice-</ulink> and <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Video_conferencing\">videochat</ulink>, groupchat),  koji će tutorijal "
"djelimično objasniti kasnije ."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Two very big instant messaging providers use Jabber/XMPP on their servers in "
"the background: Google Talk and facebook chat. Accounts within these systems "
"can be used just like normal Jabber accounts in &kopete;. Details will be "
"explained <link linkend=\"fill-in-your-account-data-in-kopete\">later</link> "
"or can be found at these provider's websites."
msgstr ""
"Dva veoma velika provajdera za instantno slanje poruka koriste Jabber/XMPP "
"na svojim serverima u pozadini: Google Razgovaraj i fejsbuk čet. Računi sa "
"ovih sistema se mogu normalno koristiti kao Jabber računi u &kopete;. "
"Detalji će biti objašnjeni <link linkend=\"fill-in-your-account-data-in-"
"kopete\">kasnije</link> ili se mogu naći na ovim provajderovim web "
"stranicama."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this information we can begin with the main part tutorial: How to set "
"up a working jabber-client and which nice features &kopete; has got."
msgstr ""
"Sa ovom informacijom možemo započeti sa glavnim dijelom tutorijala: Kako "
"podesiti radni jabber-klijent i koje prednosti &kopete; ima."

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "First steps"
msgstr "Prvi koraci"

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "Get Kopete"
msgstr "Uzmi Kopete"

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Icon of Kopete</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Ikonica Kopete</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Icon of Kopete</para>"
msgstr "<para>Ikonica Kopete</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Of course, you have to get &kopete; first before you will be able to work "
"with it. If you use a <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linux\">GNU/"
"Linux-system</ulink> there are very good chances you can find &kopete; "
"already installed (if you have already installed the <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/KDE_Software_Compilation\">KDE Software Compilation</"
"ulink>) or it will be in one of your distribution's repositories."
msgstr ""
"Naravno, prvo morate nabaviti &kopete; prije nego što budete u mogućnosti da "
"radite sa njim. Ako koristite <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linux"
"\">GNU/Linux-system</ulink>postoje veoma dobre šanse da ćete naći &kopete; "
"već instaliran (ako ste već instalirali <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/KDE_Software_Compilation\">KDE Softver Kompilaciju</ulink>) ili će biti "
"u jednom od vaših distribucijskih spremnika."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Now install &kopete; and start it for the first time."
msgstr "Sada instalirajte &kopete; i pokrenite ga prvi put."

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create your Jabber account"
msgstr "Kreirajte svoj Jabber račun."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "When you now start &kopete; you will see an empty window."
msgstr "Sada kada startate &kopete; vidjet čete prazan prozor."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Empty Kopete window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Prazni Kopete prozor</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Empty Kopete window</para>"
msgstr "<para>Prazni Kopete prozor</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the bottom section it says <guilabel>Click here to add an account</"
"guilabel>. Click there or open <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to create a new "
"account. We actually want to create a Jabber-account, so we select the menu-"
"item <guilabel>Jabber</guilabel> and click <guilabel>Next</guilabel>. After "
"clicking on <guilabel>Register new account</guilabel>, a new window opens "
"where we can write in a Jabber-server, where the account shall be created."
msgstr ""
"U donjoj sekciji piše <guilabel>Klikni ovdje da dodaš račun</guilabel>. "
"Klikni tu ili otvori <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> da kreiraš "
"novi račun. Ustavri želimo da kreiramo  Jabber-račun, tako da odaberemo meni-"
"stavku <guilabel>Jabber</guilabel> i kliknemo <guilabel>Sljedeći</guilabel>. "
"Poslije klika na <guilabel>Registruj novi račun</guilabel>, otvorit će se "
"novi prozor gdje ćemo moći pisati na Jabber-serveru, gdje će račun i biti "
"stvoren."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Configure Kopete</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Konfiguriši Kopete</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Configure Kopete</para>"
msgstr "<para>Konfiguriši Kopete</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can either manually write it into the textbox <guilabel>Jabber server</"
"guilabel> or select it from the provided list, which appears after clicking "
"on the button <guilabel>Choose...</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"Možete ga i manuelno unijeti u tekst prozor <guilabel>Jabber server</"
"guilabel> ili izabrati iz ponuđene liste, koja se pojavljuje poslije "
"klikanja na gumb <guilabel>Izaberi...</guilabel>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Server selection dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dijalog selekcije Servera</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Server selection dialog</para>"
msgstr "<para>Dijalog selekcije Servera</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After selecting a server you are able to complete your desired Jabber-ID, "
"&ie; your username. Add your preferred name in front of the <quote>@</quote> "
"in the field <guilabel>Desired Jabber ID</guilabel>. After filling in your "
"password and repeating it you should tick the checkbox <guilabel>Use "
"protocol encryption (SSL)</guilabel> for having an <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Sockets_Layer\">encrypted</ulink> client-server "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Poslije izbora servera u mogučnosti ste da kompletirate Vaš željeni Jabber-"
"ID, &ie; Vaše korisničko ime. Dodajte Vaše preferirano ime ispred <quote>@</"
"quote> u polje <guilabel>Željeni Jabber ID</guilabel>. Poslije unosa Vaše "
"lozinke i ponavljanja iste bit ćete u mogučnosti udariti kvakicu u prihvatni "
"prozorčić <guilabel>Koristi protokol zaštitu (SSL)</guilabel> kada imamo "
"<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Sockets_Layer\">encrypted</"
"ulink> klijent-server konekciju."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Create your account</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kreirajte Vaš račun</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Create your account</para>"
msgstr "<para>Kreirajte Vaš račun</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some servers might not be capable of this option, but most of them are. Now "
"click on <guilabel>Register</guilabel> to finish the registration."
msgstr ""
"Neki serveri neće imati ovu opciju, ali večina hoće. Sada klikni na "
"<guilabel>Registruj</guilabel> da kompletirate registraciju."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Congratulations, you have now registered a new account on a Jabber server!"
msgstr "Čestitamo, registrovali ste novi račun na Jabber serveru!"

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fill in your account data in Kopete"
msgstr "Popunite Vaše detalje računa u Kopete"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You now own an account on a Jabber server and &kopete; asks you for "
"<emphasis>Step two: Account information</emphasis>. &kopete; adds your "
"Jabber ID and your password into the required fields automatically. If you "
"want &kopete; to remember your password in order to not type it in every "
"time you connect with your server, check <guilabel>Remember password</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Sada posjedujete račun na Jabber serveru i &kopete; pita za <emphasis>Korak "
"dva: Informacije o računu</emphasis>. &kopete; dodaje Vaš Jabber ID i Vašu "
"lozinku u zahtjevana polja automatski. Ako želite da &kopete; upamti Vašu "
"lozinku da je ne bi morali ukucavati svaki put kada se spajate sa serverom, "
"čekirajte <guilabel>Upamti lozinku</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to use your existing accounts of <ulink url=\"http://www.google."
"com/support/chat/bin/answer.py?hl=en&amp;answer=57557\">Google Talk</ulink> "
"or Facebook chat in &kopete; (these are actually Jabber servers, too), use "
"your GMail address or your facebook account data (<ulink url=\"http://www."
"facebook.com/sitetour/chat.php\">explained here</ulink>) to connect to these "
"servers."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da koristite Vaše postojeće račune <ulink url=\"http://www.google."
"com/support/chat/bin/answer.py?hl=en&amp;answer=57557\">Google Talk</ulink> "
"ili Facebook chat u &kopete; (ovo su ustvari Jabber serveri, također), "
"koristite Vašu GMail adresu ili Vaš Facebook račun (<ulink url=\"http://www."
"facebook.com/sitetour/chat.php\">objašnjeno ovdje</ulink>) da bi se spojili "
"na ove servere."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Optionally you can check <guilabel>Exclude from connect all</guilabel>. This "
"advises &kopete; not to go online when you go online with all of your "
"&kopete; accounts (as &kopete; is a multimessenger with support for many "
"other protocols like <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICQ\">ICQ</"
"ulink> or <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/.NET_Messenger_Service"
"\">MSN</ulink>). When you checked this, you will later have to go online "
"explicitly for this one account every time you want to connect with your "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Opcionalno možete čekirati <guilabel>Isključite iz konekcije sve</guilabel>. "
"Ovi savjeti &kopete; da ne idete online kada idete online sa svim Vašim "
"&kopete; računima (zato što je &kopete; multimessenger sa podrškom za mnoge "
"druge protokole kao <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICQ\">ICQ</"
"ulink> ili <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/.NET_Messenger_Service"
"\">MSN</ulink>). Kada čekirate ovo, morat ćete kasnije ići online posebno za "
"ovaj račun svaki put kada se želite spojiti sa Vašim serverom."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your &kopete; should now look like this:"
msgstr "Vaš &kopete; bi sada trebao izgledati ovako:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Account information window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Prozor informacija o računu</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Account information window</para>"
msgstr "<para>Prozor informacija o računu</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the Tab <guilabel>Connection</guilabel> to check additional "
"options. Especially selecting <guilabel>Use protocol encryption</guilabel> "
"and the unselection of <guilabel>Allow plain-text password authentication</"
"guilabel> should be chosen for basic security reasons."
msgstr ""
"Klikni na tabulator <guilabel>Konekcija</guilabel> da provjerite dodatne "
"opcije. Posebno birajući <guilabel>Koristi protokol šifriranje</guilabel> i "
"neselektovano<guilabel>Omogući običnu tekstovnu ovjeru lozinke</guilabel> bi "
"trebalo moći izabrati iz osnovnih sigurnosnih razloga."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>default server information</guilabel> should be okay, if you "
"are in a normal home network without special <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Firewall_%28computing%29\">firewall</ulink> configuration."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Zadane server informacije</guilabel> trebale bi biti uredu, ako "
"ste u običnoj kućnoj mreži bez posebne<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Firewall_%28computing%29\">Vatrozidne</ulink> konfiguracije."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The section <emphasis>Location Settings</emphasis> is another specialty of "
"Jabber: You can set so-called <quote>Resources</quote> to identify where you "
"chat from. For example if you log in to Jabber from your mobile phone and "
"your notebook at the same time (yes, you can do that) the resource explains "
"your contacts where you are. So you could call it <quote>Notebook</quote> or "
"<quote>Android</quote>, depending on which device you're installing Kopete. "
"Remember that your resources can be seen from your chat partners (they will "
"be added to the JID like this: <userinput>romeo@montague.net/Notebook</"
"userinput>), so you might consider privacy issues while choosing your "
"resource name."
msgstr ""
"Sekcija <emphasis>Postavke lokacije</emphasis> je još jedna posebnost "
"Jabbera: Možete postaviti takozvana <quote>Sredstva</quote> da "
"identificirate odakle razgovarate. Na primjer ako se prijavite na Jabber sa "
"Vašeg mobilnog telefona i Vašeg notebooka istovremeno (da, možete to "
"uraditi) ova postavka objašnjava Vašim kontaktima gdje ste Vi. Tako ga "
"možete nazvati <quote>Notebook</quote> ili <quote>Android</quote>, u "
"zavisnosti na koji uređaj instalirate Kopete. Zapamtite da Vaša sredstva "
"mogu vidjeti i Vaši partneri sa kojima razgovarate (oni će biti dodani u JID "
"na sljedeći način: <userinput>romeo@montague.net/Notebook</userinput>), "
"trebalo bi da razmotrite pitanja privatnosti dok birate ime sredstva."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In our example, the <guilabel>Resource</guilabel> will be set to "
"<replaceable>Laptop</replaceable>. The priority is mainly useful when you "
"handle multiple devices and tells your partner's client which of your "
"devices being online at the moment (&eg; your mobile phone or your laptop) "
"to contact in this case. The highest priority number of your resources being "
"online receives the message."
msgstr ""
"U našem primjeru <guilabel>Sredstva</guilabel> bit će podešena na "
"<replaceable>Laptop</replaceable>. Ovaj prioritet je uglavnom koristan kada "
"imate više uređaja i koji govori Vašem partner klijentu koji uređaj je "
"trenutno online (&eg; Vaš mobitel ili Vaš laptop) da se spoji u ovom "
"slučaju. Najveći broj prioriteta Vašeg online sredstva će dobiti poruku."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Set the account configuration</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Podesi konfiguraciju računa</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Set the account configuration</para>"
msgstr "<para>Podesi konfiguraciju računa</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next tab, <guilabel>File Transfer</guilabel>, is normally not affected "
"when setting up a Jabber account in a normal network."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći tabulator, <guilabel>Prijenos fajla</guilabel>, normalno nije "
"obuhvaćen podešavanjem Jabber računa u običnoj mreži."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, there are some privacy configurations in the tab <guilabel>Privacy</"
"guilabel>, they are mostly self-explanatory. The option <guilabel>Use old "
"inline PGP format for signed and encrypted messages</guilabel> (read here "
"what <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pretty_Good_Privacy\">PGP</"
"ulink> means) is not recommended, because there exists a method to do this "
"with the built-in OTR, which will be explained <link linkend=\"useful-"
"configuration-hints\">later in this tutorial</link>."
msgstr ""
"Konačno, dolazimo do konfiguracije privatnosti u tabulatoru "
"<guilabel>Privatnost</guilabel>, uglavnom je samoobjašnjavajuća. Opcija "
"<guilabel>Koristiti stari usklađeni PGP format za potpisane i šifrovane "
"poruke</guilabel> (pročitaj ovdje šta <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Pretty_Good_Privacy\">PGP</ulink> znači) nije preporučljivo, zato što "
"postoji metoda da se uradi ovo ugrađenim OTR-om, koja će biti objašnjena "
"<link linkend=\"useful-configuration-hints\">kasnije u ovom tutorijalu</"
"link>."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At this point you can click <guilabel>Next</guilabel> again and your account "
"is configured now. You can choose an optional color for your account and "
"when you feel ready to connect the very first time to your Jabber server, "
"the checkbox <guilabel>Connect now</guilabel> has to be ticked."
msgstr ""
"Od sada možete kliknuti <guilabel>Sljedeći</guilabel> ponovo i Vaš račun je "
"sada konfigurisan. Možete izabrati različitu boju za Vaš račun i kada ste "
"spremni da se spojite sa Vašim Jabber serverom po prvi put, potvrdni okvirić "
"<guilabel>Connect now</guilabel>mora biti popunjen."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Last step of configuration</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Zadnji korak konfiguracije</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Last step of configuration</para>"
msgstr "<para>Zadnji korak konfiguracije</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Now you can finish the configuration."
msgstr "Sada možete završiti konfiguraciju."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Otherwise you can manually connect to the server by clicking "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Status</guimenu><guimenuitem>Online</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> in the Kopete main window or by right-clicking the Kopete symbol "
"in your tray and selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Set status</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Online</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. If you chose the "
"option <guilabel>Exclude from connect all</guilabel> earlier, you will have "
"to log in by right-clicking on the Kopete tray icon and selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>yourJID@example.org</guimenu><guimenuitem>Online</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Inače možete se i manuelno spojiti na server tako što kliknete na "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Status</guimenu><guimenuitem>Online</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> u Kopete glavnom prozoru ili desnim klikom na Kopete simbol u "
"Vašem izborniku i selektovanjem <menuchoice><guimenu>Podesi status</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Online</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Ako izaberete ovu "
"opciju <guilabel>Isključi sa spajanja sve</guilabel> ranije, morat ćete se "
"prijaviti na Kopete izbornu ikonu i selektovati "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>yourJID@example.org</guimenu><guimenuitem>Online</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Going online</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Ići online</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Going online</para>"
msgstr "<para>Ići online</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding friends"
msgstr "Dodavanje prijatelja"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After your first login, your &kopete; window is quite empty. There might be "
"a default contact added by your server which perhaps sends you a welcome "
"message, but there are no real contacts in your roster (this is by the way "
"the word for <quote>contact list</quote> in the Jabber world). The first "
"step for adding friends in Jabber is, of course, asking them for their "
"Jabber ID. When you got one, you can immediately add it to &kopete;. You can "
"either click <menuchoice><guimenu>Add</guimenu><guimenuitem>yourJID@example."
"org</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Add Contact</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>yourJID@example."
"org</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. A new window appears asking for the "
"<guilabel>Jabber ID</guilabel> we want to add to our roster. Just type it in "
"and click <guilabel>OK</guilabel>. The <guilabel>Group</guilabel> option is "
"used, when you specified groups of contacts (&eg; <quote>family</quote> and "
"<quote>work</quote>). A connection to your <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde."
"org/Special:myLanguage/KAddressBook\">KAddressBook</ulink> can be "
"established with <guilabel>Address book entry</guilabel>, so that you can "
"exchange information like profile pictures between the two applications."
msgstr ""
"Nakon Vaše prve prijave, Vaš &kopete; prozor je poprilično prazan. Možete "
"možda naići i na zadani kontakt dodan od strane servera koji Vam možda "
"pošalje i poruku dobrodošlice, ali nema stvarnih kontakata u Vašem spisku "
"imena (usput ovo je riječ za <quote>kontakt lista</quote> u Jabber "
"okruženju). Prvi korak u dodavanju prijatelja u Jabberu je, naravno, pitati "
"ih za njihov Jabber ID. Kada dobijete jedan, odmah ga možete dodati na "
"&kopete;. Možete kliknuti na <menuchoice><guimenu>Dodaj</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>yourJID@example.org</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu><guisubmenu>Dodaj kontakt</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>yourJID@example.org</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Novi "
"prozor će se pojaviti i pitat Vas za <guilabel>Jabber ID</guilabel> koji "
"želimo da dodamo u Vaš spisak imena. Samo ga ukucajte i kliknite "
"<guilabel>OK</guilabel>. <guilabel>Grupa</guilabel> opcija se koristi, kada "
"precizirate grupe kontakata (&eg; <quote>Porodica</quote> i <quote>posao</"
"quote>). Spajanje na Vaš <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/Special:"
"myLanguage/KAddressBook\">KAdresar</ulink> može biti uspostavljeno sa "
"<guilabel>Ulaza adresara</guilabel>, tako da možete razmjenjivati profilne "
"slike između dvije aplikacije."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Adding a friend</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dodavanje prijatelja</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Adding a friend</para>"
msgstr "<para>Dodavanje prijatelja</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you've added your first friend to your roster. But before you can start "
"writing messages to him or her, your contact has to authorize your request. "
"Until this happens, the contact appears with a small yellow exclamation mark "
"on the right side of his contact field."
msgstr ""
"Sada možete dodati Vašeg prvog prijatelja u spisak imena. Ali prije nego što "
"počnete pisati poruke njemu ili njoj, Vaš kontakt mora da odobri Vaš "
"zahtjev. Dok se ovo ne desi, kontakt će se pojaviti sa malim žutim "
"uskličnikom sa desne strane kontaktnog polja."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Your contact</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Vaš kontakt</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Your contact</para>"
msgstr "<para>Vaš kontakt</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When your friend authorized your request or added you to his or her roster, "
"its icon will appear colored when online. The exact meanings of the "
"different icons (Online, Away &etc;) can be seen at <guilabel>Status</"
"guilabel> where you can set them yourself, too. You receive a notification "
"when you are authorized."
msgstr ""
"Kada Vam prijatelj odobri Vaš zahtjev ili Vas doda na njegov ili njezin "
"spisak imena, njihova ikona će biti obojena kada budu online. Tačna značenja "
"različitih ikona (Online, Na putu, itd;) mogu se vidjeti na "
"<guilabel>Statusu</guilabel> gdje ih lično također možete postaviti. Primit "
"ćete obavijest kada ste prihvaćeni."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Normally, your friend will put you also to his or her contact list, so you "
"have to authorize this request by yourself, too. &kopete; notifies about "
"that at the bottom with a green flag and the description of the request. "
"Click on <guilabel>Authorize</guilabel> to accept. The notification area can "
"be closed by clicking on the cross on the upper-right side of the area."
msgstr ""
"Normalno, Vaš prijatelj će Vas isto tako dodati u njegovu ili njenu "
"kontaktnu listu, tako da ćete morati odobriti ovaj zahtjev lično, također. "
"&kopete; obaviještava o tome na dnu sa zelenom zastavicom i opisom zahtjeva. "
"Kliknite na <guilabel>Odobri</guilabel> da prihvatite. Obaviještenje može "
"biti zatvoreno klikom na iksić u gornjem desnom uglu."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>You're now added by your contact</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Sada ste dodati od strane Vašeg kontakta</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>You're now added by your contact</para>"
msgstr "<para>Sada ste dodati od strane Vašeg kontakta</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After that procedure you should see a contact list like in the next image."
msgstr ""
"Poslije ove procedure trebali bi ste vidjeti kontaktnu listu kao na "
"sljedećoj slici."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Your contact is fully authorized</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Vaš kontakt je u potpunosti odobren</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Your contact is fully authorized</para>"
msgstr "<para>Vaš kontakt je u potpunosti odobren</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "You successfully added your first contact to your roster now."
msgstr "Sada ste uspješno dodali Vaš prvi kontakt u spisak imena."

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid "Messaging and sending files"
msgstr "Pisanje poruka i slanje datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can start chatting with a contact by clicking on the name. A new window "
"will open and you can type in messages into the smaller field at the bottom, "
"where the cursor already resides. When you want to send your text, hit "
"&Enter; or press the <guilabel>Send</guilabel> button. You and your partner "
"can communicate now via Jabber."
msgstr ""
"Možete početi ćaskati sa kontaktom klikom na ime. Novi prozor će se otvoriti "
"i Vi možete pisati poruke u malom polje na dnu, gdje se već nalazi kursor. "
"Kada želite poslati Vaš tekst, pritisnite &Enter; ili pritisnite "
"<guilabel>Pošalji</guilabel> gumb. Vi i Vaš partner sada možete komunicirati "
"preko Jabbera."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Your first chat</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Vaše prvo ćaskanje</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Your first chat</para>"
msgstr "<para>Vaše prvo ćaskanje</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transfer files"
msgstr "Prijenos datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To transfer files via Jabber click on <guilabel>Send File</guilabel> and "
"select the file you want to send in the popup window. You will be notified "
"when the transaction is complete or failed for some reason."
msgstr ""
"Za prijenos datoteka preko Jabbera klikni na <guilabel>Pošalji datoteku</"
"guilabel> i odaberite datoteku koja želite poslati u novootvorenom prozoru. "
"Bit ćete obaviješteni kad je transakcija završena ili propala iz nekog "
"razloga."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This may not work in some cases due to incompatible configurations of some "
"servers"
msgstr ""
"Ovo neće raditi u nekim slučajevima zbog neuskladivosti konfiguracije nekih "
"servera"

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "Group chat"
msgstr "Grupno ćaskanje"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Jabber is not only capable of communicating with one person. You can use "
"Group Chat to do an <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IRC\">IRC</"
"ulink> style discussion, where many people can talk with each other. To use "
"Group Chat, you have to right-click on the &kopete; systray icon, and select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu><replaceable>yourJID</replaceable></"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Join Groupchat...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, where "
"<replaceable>yourJID</replaceable> stands for your own Jabber ID. A new "
"window appears where you can join a chatroom."
msgstr ""
"Jabber samo nije u stanju da komunicira sa jednom osobom. Možete koristiti "
"grupno ćaskanje <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IRC\">IRC</ulink> "
"kao stil razgovora, gdje razni ljudi mogu međusobno razgovarati. Da bi "
"koristili grupno ćaskanje, morate desnim klikom kliknuti na &kopete; systray "
"ikonu, i odabrati <menuchoice><guimenu><replaceable>VašJID</replaceable></"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Pridruži se grupnom ćaskanju...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, gdje <replaceable>VašJID</replaceable> stoji kao lični Jabber "
"ID. Novi prozor se pojavljuje gdje se možete pridružiti sobi za ćaskanje."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Groupchat</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Grupnoćaskanje</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Groupchat</para>"
msgstr "<para>Grupnoćaskanje</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on <guilabel>Query</guilabel> to show the list of existing chatrooms "
"on your Jabber server. Select one and press &Enter; to enter this room."
msgstr ""
"Klikni na <guilabel>Pitanje</guilabel> da bi vidjeli listu postojećih soba "
"za ćaskanja na Vašem Jabber serveru. Odaberite jednu i pritisnite &Enter; da "
"uđete u istu."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can type in and create your own chatroom by writing its "
"name into the line <guilabel>Room</guilabel>. Then press &Enter; or click "
"<guilabel>Join</guilabel> to join."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno možete ukucati i stvoriti Vašu ličnu sobu za ćaskanje pisanjem "
"njenog imena u liniju <guilabel>Soba</guilabel>. Zatim pritisnite &Enter; "
"ili kliknite <guilabel>Pridruži se</guilabel> da bi se pridružili."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you created the chatroom, you'll see a new field appearing in your "
"&kopete; window with the JID <replaceable>chatroomname@jabber.example.org</"
"replaceable>. Treat it as a normal contact, &ie; you have to click on this "
"JID to chat &etc;"
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste stvorili sobu za ćaskanje, yidjet ćete novo polje koje se "
"pojavljuje u Vašem &kopete; prozoru sa JID <replaceable>chatroomname@jabber."
"example.org</replaceable>. Tretirajte ga kao obični kontakt, &ie; morate "
"kliknuti na ovaj JID da bi ćaskali &etc;"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At this point you have set up a working Jabber client and are in principle "
"able to chat with your contacts. But for a better experience of &kopete;, "
"you are able to configure the application for your best needs. A set of "
"<link linkend=\"useful-configuration-hints\">Useful configuration hints</"
"link> is the content of the next page in this tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Do sada ste postavili radni Jabber klijent i u mogućnosti ste u principu da "
"ćaskate sa vašim kontaktima. Ali za bolje iskustvo &kopete;, možete da "
"konfigurišete aplikaciju po Vašim potrebama. Set <link linkend=\"useful-"
"configuration-hints\">Korisnih konfiguracijskih savjeta</link> je sadržaj "
"sljedeće stranice u ovom tutorijalu."

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid "Useful configuration hints"
msgstr "Korisni konfiguracijski savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These hints all refer to &kopete;'s main configuration window residing under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Be sure to click on <guilabel>Apply</guilabel> or "
"<guilabel>OK</guilabel> if you want your changes to be saved."
msgstr ""
"Ovi savjeti se odnose na &kopete;glavni konfiguracijski prozor koji se "
"nalazi ispod <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Obavezno "
"kliknite <guilabel>Prijmjeniti</guilabel> ili <guilabel>OK</guilabel>ako "
"želite da se promjene spase."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All adjustments affecting your account setup and configuration of multiple "
"accounts in &kopete; (Jabber/XMPP as well as <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Icq\">ICQ</ulink>, <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/.NET_Messenger_Service\">MSN</ulink> and many other messaging "
"protocols) can be found under the tab <guilabel>Accounts</guilabel>. If you "
"want to set your personal information or are willing to use a contact photo, "
"click on <guilabel>Modify Identity...</guilabel> and make your settings. A "
"photo can be uploaded by clicking on the small icon on the left hand side at "
"the bottom of the image area."
msgstr ""
"Sve prilagodbe utječu na postavke Vašeg računa i konfiguraciju više računa u "
"&kopete; (Jabber / XMPP kao <ulink url = \"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Icq"
"\">ICQ</ulink>, <ulink url =\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/."
"NET_Messenger_Service\">MSN</ulink> i mnogi drugi protokoli slanja poruka) "
"moge se naći na kartici <guilabel>Računi</guilabel>. Ako želite postaviti "
"svoje lične podatke ili da su spremni da koriste fotografiju kontakta, "
"kliknite na <guilabel> Izmijeni identitet ... </guilabel> i postavite svoje "
"postavke. Slika može biti učitana klikom na malu ikonu na lijevoj strani pri "
"dnu slike."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:390
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Setting identity</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Postavke identiteta</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Setting identity</para>"
msgstr "<para>Postavke identiteta</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next tab in the vertical list at the left hand side is <guilabel>Contact "
"List</guilabel>. These settings are mainly self-explanatory and it seems "
"useful to enable <guilabel>Use contact photos when available</guilabel>. The "
"other three horizontal tabs (<guilabel>Colors &amp; Fonts</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> and <guilabel>Layout</guilabel>) include quite "
"special settings you will perhaps fine-tune when you have used &kopete; for "
"a few weeks."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći tabular u vertikalnoj listi na lijevoj strani je <guilabel>Kontakt "
"lista</guilabel>. Ove postavke su uglavnom razumljive same po sebi i čini se "
"korisnim da se omogući <guilabel>Koristi kontakt slike kada su dostupne</"
"guilabel>. Ostala tri horizontalna tabulara (<guilabel>Boje &amp; Fontovi</"
"guilabel>,<guilabel>Napredno</guilabel> i <guilabel> Raspored </guilabel>) "
"uključuju sasvim posebne postavke koje ćete možda dodatno podešavati kada "
"budete koristili &kopete; nakon nekoliko nedelja."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Status</guilabel> configurations enable you to set your "
"default <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Status_message\">status "
"messages</ulink> when you're set as Online, Away, Invisible &etc;"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Status</guilabel> konfiguracije Vam omogućuju da podesite zadane "
"<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Status_message\">status poruke</"
"ulink> kada ste postavili Online, Na putu, Nevidljiv &etc;"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking on <guilabel>Behavior</guilabel> opens a quite detailed set of "
"configuration. The most interesting ones, that can be found in the tab "
"<guilabel>General</guilabel> are <guilabel>Message Handling</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Initial Status</guilabel>. The first one decides if incoming "
"messages from your contacts open instantly a new window or if they are "
"queued until you open &kopete; yourself. The second one tells &kopete; if it "
"shall go online when you start the program. When you set this, you are "
"always available for your contacts once you run &kopete;. The tab "
"<guilabel>Events</guilabel> lets you set in what cases &kopete; notifies you "
"via your computer's notification system (in most cases <guilabel>KNotify</"
"guilabel>). When you want &kopete; to set your status automatically to "
"<quote>Away</quote>, open the tab <guilabel>Away Settings</guilabel> and "
"enable the first checkbox. You can set the time that has to pass after your "
"last action (keyboard input or mouse movement) that &kopete; will set you as "
"<quote>away</quote>. The default value is 10 minutes. Options located in "
"<guilabel>Chat</guilabel> are again self-explanatory and already set to "
"useful values."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na <guilabel>Ponašanje</guilabel> otvara se sasvim detaljni set "
"konfiguracija. Najzanimljivije su one, koji se mogu naći na kartici "
"<guilabel>Generalno</guilabel> su <guilabel>Bavljenje porukama</guilabel> i "
"<guilabel> Inicijalni status </guilabel>. Prvi odlučuje da li dolazne poruke "
"iz kontakata otvoriti odmah u novom prozoru, ili ako su u redu čekanja dok "
"se ne otvorite &kopete; lično. Druga kaže &kopete; hoće li ići online kada "
"pokrenete program. Kada postavite ovo, uvijek ste na raspolaganju za svoje "
"kontakte kada jednom pokrenete &kopete;. Kartica <guilabel>Događaji</"
"guilabel> vam omogućava da postavite u kojim slučajevima &kopete; će vas "
"obavijestiti preko sistema obaviještenja vašeg računara (u većini slučajeva "
"<guilabel>KNotify</guilabel>). Kada želite &kopete; da automatski podesi vaš "
"status na <quote>Na putu</quote>, otvorite karticu <guilabel>Postavke na "
"putu</guilabel> i omogući prvu potvrdu. Možete postaviti vrijeme koje mora "
"proći nakon zadnje akcije (unos sa tastature ili pokret miša) koji &kopete; "
"će vas postaviti kao <quote>na putu</quote>. Zadana vrijednost je 10 minuta. "
"Opcije locirane u <guilabel>Ćaskanje</guilabel> opet su samo po sebi "
"objašnjive i već postavljene na korisne vrijednosti."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:404
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next item in the vertical row on the left is <guilabel>Chat Window</"
"guilabel>. The first tab in there, <guilabel>Style</guilabel>, can be used "
"to set another appearance than the default one. You can also install your "
"own styles or download new ones from the Internet by clicking on "
"<guilabel>Get New...</guilabel>. When you type in an <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Emoticon\">Emoticon</ulink> during a conversation, "
"&kopete; will convert it into a graphical emoticon by default. To disable "
"this feature or to use another set of emoticons go to <guilabel>Emoticons</"
"guilabel>. The last tab, <guilabel>Colors &amp; Fonts</guilabel> is again "
"self-explanatory and configures these preferences of your chat window."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeća stavka u vertikalnom nizu na lijevoj strani je <guilabel>Prozor "
"ćaskanja</guilabel>. Prvi tab tamo, <guilabel>Stil</guilabel>, može se "
"koristiti za postavljanje još jedne pojave u odnosu na zadanu. Također "
"možete instalirati svoje vlastite stilove ili preuzeti nove sa interneta "
"klikom na <guilabel> Get New ... </guilabel>. Kada upišete u <ulink url="
"\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emoticon\">Emotikon</ulink> tokom razgovora, "
"&kopete; će ga pretvoriti  u grafički emotikon po defaultu. Da biste "
"onemogućili ovu funkciju ili da koristite drugi set emotikona idite na "
"<guilabel>Emotikoni</guilabel>. Poslednji tab, <guilabel> Boje &amp; Fontovi "
"</guilabel> je opet sam po sebi objašnjiv i konfigurira ove preference vašeg "
"prozora za razgovor."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Webcam\">Webcams</ulink> are "
"supported in &kopete;, but at the moment (November 2010) there are still "
"some difficulties concerning video chat, so settings in <guilabel>Video</"
"guilabel> are made at your own responsibility, because it's quite possible "
"it doesn't work in the right way. The <ulink url=\"http://forum.kde.org/"
"viewforum.php?f=18\">KDE Forums</ulink> may be helpful while dealing with "
"webcam issues."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Webcam\"> Web kamere </ulink> su "
"podržane u &kopete;, ali u ovom trenutku (novembar 2010) još uvijek postoje "
"neke poteškoće u vezi video chat-a, tako da postavke u <guilabel> Video </"
"guilabel> su napravljene na vlastitu odgovornost, jer sasvim je moguće da ne "
"radi na pravi način. The <ulink url=\"http://forum.kde.org/viewforum.php?"
"f=18\"> KDE Forumi </ulink> mogu biti od pomoći jer se bave pitanjima "
"problema vezanim za web kamere."

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Priključci"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A very powerful feature of &kopete; is the capability of using plugins. "
"There is a set of plugins pre-installed (new ones can be installed for "
"example with your &Linux; distro's package manager) and they can be enabled "
"and configured under <guilabel>Plugins</guilabel>. You can enable them by "
"setting the tick into the respective checkbox. Most of them are again self-"
"explanatory, but the most useful ones will be explained here anyway. A very "
"helpful plugin is the <guilabel>History</guilabel>. With this option "
"enabled, Kopete will log all your chats and write it onto your hard disk. "
"You can read it in your chat window, when you select the <guilabel>View "
"History</guilabel> icon or you open it with <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>View History</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Vrlo moćna karakteristika &kopete; je sposobnost korištenja priključaka. "
"Postoji skup priključaka preinstaliranih (novi se mogu instalirati kao na "
"primjer na vašem &Linux; pomoću paketa menadžera distro-a), a oni mogu biti "
"uključeni i konfigurirani pod <guilabel>Priključcima</guilabel>. Možete ih "
"omogućiti popunjavanjem okvira u odgovarajućem potvrdnom prozoru . Većina od "
"njih su opet sami po sebi objašnjivi, ali oni najkorisniji  će biti ovdje "
"ionako objašnjeni. A vrlo koristan priključak je <guilabel> Historija </"
"guilabel>. Uz ovu omogućenu opciju, Kopete će prijaviti sva svoja ćaskanja i "
"pisati ih na vaš hard disk. Možete ga pročitati u prozoru za ćaskanje, kada "
"odaberete <guilabel> Pregledaj Historiju </guilabel> ikonu ili ga otvorite "
"sa <menuchoice> <guimenu> Alati </guimenu><guimenuitem>Pregledaj Historiju</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: jabber.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>OTR</title>"
msgstr "<title>OTR</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One of the most important plugins considering privacy issues is <ulink url="
"\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Off-the-Record_Messaging\">OTR</ulink>. This "
"piece of software encrypts your entire conversation from one end to the "
"other and makes it impossible for third persons to read your conversation. "
"After you enabled the plugin, you have to open its settings (click on the "
"wrench icon) and <guilabel>Generate</guilabel> a key."
msgstr ""
"Jedan od najvažnijih priključaka s obzirom na probleme privatnosti je <ulink "
"url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Off-the-Record_Messaging\"> OTR </ulink>. "
"Ovaj komad softvera šifrira vaš cijeli razgovor sa jednog na drugi kraj i "
"čini nemogućim za treće osobe da budu u stanju da pročitaju vaš razgovor. "
"Nakon što ste omogućili priključak, morate otvoriti svoje postavke (kliknite "
"na ikonu ključa) i <guilabel> Generiranje </guilabel> ključ."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Generate an OTR key</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Generirati  OTR ključ</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Generate an OTR key</para>"
msgstr "<para>Generirati  OTR ključ</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This may take a while and you have to wait until &kopete; finished. After "
"that close the OTR window with <guilabel>OK</guilabel> and <guilabel>Apply</"
"guilabel> the changes. You eventually will have to restart &kopete; after "
"this. Then open a chat window of the contact you want to safely communicate "
"with. Go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guisubmenu>OTR Settings</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Start OTR Session</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or use "
"the icon <menuchoice><guimenu>OTR Encryption</guimenu><guimenuitem>Start OTR "
"Session</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. &kopete; will start the session if your "
"contact is capable of OTR, otherwise you'll receive an error message."
msgstr ""
"Ovo može potrajati i morate čekati dok &kopete; završi. Nakon toga zatvorite "
"OTR prozor s <guilabel> OK </guilabel> i <guilabel> Prihvati </guilabel> "
"promjene. Vi ćete na kraju morati restartovati &kopete; nakon ovoga. Zatim "
"otvorite prozor ćaskanja kontakta sa kojim želite da sigurno komunicirate. "
"Idi na <menuchoice> <guimenu> Alati </guimenu> <guisubmenu> Postavke OTR </"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem> Pokreni OTR Sesiju </guimenuitem> </menuchoice> "
"ili koristite ikonu <menuchoice> <guimenu> OTR Šifrovanje </guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem> Pokreni OTR Sesiju </guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. &kopete; će "
"početi sesiju ako je vaš kontakt  sposoban za OTR, inače ćete dobiti poruku "
"o grešci."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>First use of OTR</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Prva upotreba OTR</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:444
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>First use of OTR</para>"
msgstr "<para>Prva upotreba OTR</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:449
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To ensure your added contact is really the one he or she is pretending, it's "
"necessary to authenticate him or her one time. You can do this by calling "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guisubmenu>OTR Settings</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Authenticate contact</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. You "
"may choose between three options:"
msgstr ""
"Da bi osigurali da je vaš dodani kontakt  zaista onaj koji koriste on ili "
"ona , to je potrebno da bi njega ili nju jednom potvrdili autentičnost. To "
"možete učiniti pozivom <menuchoice> <guimenu> Alati </guimenu> <guisubmenu> "
"Postavke OTR </guisubmenu> <guimenuitem> Autentičnost kontakta </"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. Možete birati između tri opcije:"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:452
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first one is to ask your chat partner a question whose answer can only "
"be known by him or her and you."
msgstr ""
"Prva je da pitate Vašeg sugovornika pitanje čiji odgovor može znati samo on "
"ili ona."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next possibility is a secret passphrase your partner has to know (you "
"may consider giving the secret to him or her via another secure "
"communication channel, &eg; telephone)."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeća mogućnost je tajna sigurnosna lozinka koju vaš partner mora znati "
"(možete razmotriti davanje tajni  njemu ili njoj preko drugih sigurnosnih "
"komunikacijskih kanala,&eg; telefona)."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:456
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Thirdly, there's the option of manually checking the OTR fingerprint. This "
"is the most secure option, but it's not very handy and if you can choose one "
"of the others it may be more comfortable and faster. When checking the "
"fingerprint, you have to ask your partner for his or her OTR fingerprint "
"over a secure connection (&eg; telephone or encrypted E-Mail) so that the "
"fingerprint can be checked."
msgstr ""
"Treća, tu je i mogućnost ručne kontrole OTR otiska prsta. Ovo je "
"najsigurnija opcija, ali to nije baš zgodno, i ako možete odabrati jednu od "
"ostalih to može biti ugodnije i brže. Kada provjeravate otisak prsta, morate "
"pitati vašeg partnera za njegov ili njen OTR otisak prsta putem sigurne veze "
"(&eg; telefona ili šifriranog e-maila), tako da otisak prsta može provjeriti."

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let's assume we choose option one and ask our partner a question. Type it "
"into the field and define the expected answer your partner has to give, so "
"that he or she can be authenticated."
msgstr ""
"Pretpostavimo da biramo opciju jedan i pitatamo našeg partnera pitanje. "
"Upišite ga u polje i definirajte očekivani odgovor od vašeg partnera koji "
"mora dati, tako da on ili ona mogu potvrditi svoju autentičnost."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:469
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Asking a secret question</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pitanje lozinke</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Asking a secret question</para>"
msgstr "<para>Pitanje lozinke</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When we continue, your partner will see the question and if the answer is "
"correct, OTR is set up ready now."
msgstr ""
"Kada nastavite, vaš partner će vidjeti pitanje, i ako je odgovor ispravan, "
"OTR je postavljen spreman."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:487
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Finished OTR setup</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Završi OTR podešavanje</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Finished OTR setup</para>"
msgstr "<para>Završi OTR podešavanje</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your partner may do the same thing in return, so when you see a window "
"asking you for authentication just answer the question and you are an "
"authenticated user in your friend's contact list, too."
msgstr ""
"Vaš partner može učiniti istu stvar, tako da kad vidite prozor  za "
"autentifikaciju samo odgovorite na pitanje,i vi ste potvrđeni korisnik u "
"prijateljevoj kontakt listi, također."

#. Tag: phrase
#: jabber.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>OTR authentication</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>OTR autentifikacija</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>OTR authentication</para>"
msgstr "<para>OTR autentifikacija</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: jabber.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every time you communicate safely, you'll see the green armored keylock icon "
"at the top of your chat window. To finish the secure connection, you can "
"either close your chat window or click on <menuchoice><guimenu>OTR "
"Encryption</guimenu><guimenuitem>End OTR Session</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Svaki put kada sigurno komunicirate, vidjet ćete ikonu zelene zaključane "
"brave na vrhu vašeg prozora za ćaskanje. Da biste završili sigurnu "
"konekciju, možete ili zatvoriti prozor za ćaskanje ili kliknuti na "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu> OTR Šifriranje </guimenu> <guimenuitem> Kraj OTR "
"Sesije </guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
